<td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span id="xdx_F01_zgCpuubiWaOg" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(1)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1B_zq94eZJiL9Kk" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001480" xml:lang="en-US">In the six months
ended June 30, 2026, <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zR2U3EptntJ8" title="Restricted stock units granted" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001482" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">135,540</ix:nonFraction></span> RSUs were granted to officers and consultants of the Company, with a total grant date fair value of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsAggregateIntrinsicValueOutstanding_iI_c20260630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zkSB1aG4ruG9" title="Grant date of fair value" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsAggregateIntrinsicValueOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001484" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">600,300</ix:nonFraction></span>
as measured at an average $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue_iI_c20260630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zhQbyfyHKAUf" title="Volume weighted average price" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001486" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">4.43</ix:nonFraction></span>/share trailing to the date the RSU all granted with time-based vesting of four years.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span id="xdx_F05_zqMMNqfwkYMc" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(2)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1F_zIO9uUHBXUae" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001487" xml:lang="en-US">In the six months
ended June 30, 2026, <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod_pid_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_z0BscSQmTkSh" title="Restricted stock units vested" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001489" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">27,250</ix:nonFraction></span> RSUs vested and were settled through the issuance of <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_pid_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zroyvH7CRlol" title="Issuance of shares of common stock" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001491" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">27,250</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span id="xdx_F07_zGW3lNEFOw8j" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(3)</span></td><td id="xdx_F13_zl50GBggVozi" style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001492" xml:lang="en-US">In
                                                                                                                                                               the six months ended June 30, 2026, <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsForfeitedInPeriod_pid_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--ServiceAgreementsMember_zBWsrlMOhHw3" title="Forfeited shares" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsForfeitedInPeriod" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_ServiceAgreementsMember" id="Fact001494" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">40,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
                                                                                                                                                               RSUs were forfeited upon termination or amendment of employment and service agreements with former executives and consultants of the
                                                                                                                                                               Company.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span id="xdx_F00_zWQQlBLwQTm8" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(4)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F13_z7bOUdRpCKQc" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001495" xml:lang="en-US"><span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zsej7fHT1R9l" title="Restricted stock units granted" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001497" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">351,042</ix:nonFraction></span> RSUs were
granted to officers and consultants of the Company, with a total grant date fair value of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsAggregateIntrinsicValueOutstanding_iI_c20250630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_z2EK6n6l3ss6" title="Grant date of fair value" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsAggregateIntrinsicValueOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001499" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,915,753</ix:nonFraction></span> as measured at an average $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue_iI_c20250630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zMQJrIP18u9f" title="Volume weighted average price" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001501" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">5.46</ix:nonFraction></span>/share
trailing to the date the RSU was granted, as follows: (i) <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zXKCaI9qVUy2" title="Restricted stock units vested grant" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001503" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">326,042</ix:nonFraction></span> RSUs which immediately vested upon grant and (ii) <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedNumberOfShares_pid_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zHe4jcg7E6r3" title="Restricted stock units vested" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedNumberOfShares" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001505" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">25,000</ix:nonFraction></span> RSUs with
time-based vesting of four years.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span id="xdx_F01_zMTEhXdXnlM9" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(5)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1D_z9vr8WGaQ4R5" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001506" xml:lang="en-US"><span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod_pid_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zc0UTjWWfAH3" title="Restricted stock units vested" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001508" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">379,042</ix:nonFraction></span> RSUs vested
and were settled through the issuance of <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_pid_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zIIrIubuVQN3" title="Issuance of shares of common stock" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001510" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">379,042</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span id="xdx_F07_zFM7h5u2Sogk" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(6)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F14_zZvT5axeR3K9" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001511" xml:lang="en-US"><span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsForfeitedInPeriod_pid_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--ServiceAgreementsMember_z4BpF0xL88Fe" title="Forfeited shares" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENIQU5HRSBJTiBSRVNUUklDVEVEIFNUT0NLIFVOSVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsForfeitedInPeriod" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_ServiceAgreementsMember" id="Fact001513" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">8,750</ix:nonFraction></span> RSUs were
forfeited upon termination of employment and service agreements with former executives and consultants of the Company.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr></table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A0_zTUNmg9r0Ezj" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-right: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.15pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the three six months ended June 30, 2026, the Company recorded $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20260401__20260630__us-gaap--AwardDateAxis__custom--CommonStockAwardsMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zrP8J4E1Vxp6" title="Stock-based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-06-30_custom_CommonStockAwardsMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001515" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">172,186</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--AwardDateAxis__custom--CommonStockAwardsMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zBoOfGkX6824" title="Stock-based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_custom_CommonStockAwardsMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001517" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">419,403</ix:nonFraction></span>  in stock-based compensation expense from
the Company&#8217;s RSU activity in the period ($<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20250401__20250630__us-gaap--AwardDateAxis__custom--CommonStockAwardsMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_z39AFvJI4cD7" title="Stock-based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2025-04-012025-06-30_custom_CommonStockAwardsMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001519" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">492,565</ix:nonFraction></span>
and $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--AwardDateAxis__custom--CommonStockAwardsMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zRLOERGzHx7" title="Stock-based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_custom_CommonStockAwardsMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001521" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">3,389,533</ix:nonFraction></span>
during the three and six months ended June 30, 2025).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.15pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.15pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Other
stock incentives measured at fair value through profit or loss</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.15pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.15pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of June 30, 2026, the Company had certain other outstanding obligations to issue shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock in the event
certain market conditions are met pursuant to an officer&#8217;s employment agreement, as further disclosed in the &#8216;Derivative
liabilities&#8217; section above. These were designated as liability-classified awards and are measured at fair value through profit
or loss. As of June 30, 2026, the Company recognized a $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DerivativeLiabilitiesCurrent_iI_c20260630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--OfficersEmploymentAgreementMember_zZjAPI7R6e3f" title="Derivative liability"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DerivativeLiabilitiesCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_OfficersEmploymentAgreementMember" id="Fact001523" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">171</ix:nonFraction></span> derivative liability and would have been obligated to issue <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--OfficersEmploymentAgreementMember_zk47cGyftK53" title="Number of shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_custom_OfficersEmploymentAgreementMember" id="Fact001525" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">300,310</ix:nonFraction></span> shares
of common stock pursuant to these other stock incentives had the conditions of such stock incentives been met (December 31, 2025: recognized
a $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DerivativeLiabilitiesCurrent_iI_c20251231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--OfficersEmploymentAgreementMember_z4Xi0iN4YM0h" title="Derivative liability"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DerivativeLiabilitiesCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_OfficersEmploymentAgreementMember" id="Fact001527" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">15,072</ix:nonFraction></span></span>
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">derivative liability relating to <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--OfficersEmploymentAgreementMember_zCSzYxXhoj8a" title="Number of shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_OfficersEmploymentAgreementMember" id="Fact001529" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">265,685</ix:nonFraction></span></span>
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">shares of common stock that the Company would have been obligated
to issue had the conditions of the stock incentives been met).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


